<title>USA: TransAmerican Waste extends warrant dates.</title>
<headline>TransAmerican Waste extends warrant dates.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransAmerican Waste Industries Inc said on Friday that it extended the expiration date of its Class A and Class B warrants from November 11, 1996 to November 11, 1997.</p>
<p>Class A warrants entitle holders to one share of common stock and a Class B warrant for $4.50. The Class B warrants entitle holders to one share of common stock at an exercise price of $6.53, the company said.</p>
</text>
